WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.332
Bua wɔ SaloneHCM ma — Sierra Leone i human capital management ɛn payroll platform.

2
00:00:05.332 --> 00:00:18.346
Ndɔ nɛhunwa kpindi lɛ lɔlɔma le, mu sign in lɔ wɔ lɔ kɛ yɛpɛ yila lɔlɔ, mu nyandemɔ gbi dashboard ti yɛ, mu lɔnɔ navigation ti lɛ, a mu ya hinda ngi ngi wayɛ mu longa i feature wubu lɛ bi guama. I bi ba yɛpɛma.

3
00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:24.694
Ndii le sign-in page. Kpɛkɛ i sɛkulu email ɛn password ngi bi administrator ya hu wɔma.

4
00:00:24.694 --> 00:00:33.329
Bi nɔ i sɛkulu numu ya two-factor authentication yɛndɛ nyaha ngɛ, bi hu wɔ bi yɛpɛma ɔma code nɔniɔmɔ gɔli hani i authenticator app ni ti.

5
00:00:33.329 --> 00:00:36.770
Bi ɔ lɔ sawa mu sign in gbi system administrator gɔɔli.

6
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.729
Ɛn ya le i dashboard — SaloneHCM i pela.

7
00:00:40.729 --> 00:00:50.645
Gulei bi ɔ longa i key performance indicators bi li lenga yɛlɛi: headcount wubu, kundɔ nyandei payroll i kpaa, leave requests bi ti liama, ɛn compliance status.

8
00:00:50.645 --> 00:00:54.426
Hu wubu lenga kɔ time wubu ma bi i sɛkulu timei bia sɛkɛ gbi.

9
00:00:55.250 --> 00:01:04.387
Heiɛ le i navigation sidebar. I bi ya ye kpindi ɛn i module bi nɔɔ i kulɔ ɛn i sɛkulu i plan lenga — nga bi lɔ nɔɔ ndɔi bi lenga le bi longa kpɛkɛ.

10
00:01:04.387 --> 00:01:09.794
Core HR hinda ti gbea gulei, payroll ɛn finance lenga a huma, bɔi administration tools.

11
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.782
Ɔ hu yɛkpɛ i ngi hinda ya ee? Feature Directory ma yɛndɛ.

12
00:01:14.782 --> 00:01:25.936
Module wubu bi ti platform li ya lekɛ yaa, bi va pe kɔ function gɔɔli, ɛn nyandemɔ ngutɔngɔ ɛn status ngi lenga yɛ — available, a higher plan hu wɔɔ, kɛ bi administrators ta likpɛ.

13
00:01:25.936 --> 00:01:29.778
Card hu wubu bi available ya pui nga bi kpɛlɛngɔ yaa te ye lɔ.

14
00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:46.029
Kɛ falɛ ɛ, lolui fele longaa: i settings page hinda yaa i password ɛn two-factor security i kulɔ, ɛn Training Center — ngi bi ndɛ video ndɔɔ longa yɛ — i bi quick reference cards, knowledge base articles, ɛn certification quizzes kulɔ wubu ta.

15
00:01:46.029 --> 00:01:47.306
Ɔ gbii nyandemɔ lɔnɔ.
